#API for QuizQuestionView
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/quiz/questions/
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/quiz/answer/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question_id" : 1,
    "answer" : "Python"
}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/quiz/result/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "answers": [
        {
            "question_id": 1,
            "answer": "Python"
        },
        {
            "question_id": 2,
            "answer": "List"
        },
        {
            "question_id": 3,
            "answer": "GET"
        }
    ]
}